function sched(L,micro,n,extra=0){let B=L,pi=pmt(L,micro,n),ci=0,rows=[];for(let t=1;t<=n&&B>0;t++){const i=intr(B,micro);let reg=Math.min(pi,B+i),pr=Math.min(B,reg-i);if(t===n){reg+=B-pr;pr=B}let ex=Math.min(extra,B-pr);B-=pr+ex;ci+=i;rows.push({t,B,i});}return {rows,ci,pi}}
// PMI: price 500k, 10% down, L=450k, 6.5%, 30y
const s=sched(45000000,65000,360);
const t78=s.rows.find(r=>r.B<=0.78*50000000).t, t80=s.rows.find(r=>r.B<=0.80*50000000).t;
console.log('pi',s.pi/100,'78% month',t78,'80% month',t80,'bal at 78',s.rows[t78-1].B/100);
// extra $200 on 400k loan
const a=sched(40000000,65000,360),b=sched(40000000,65000,360,20000);
console.log('base months',a.rows.length,'int',(a.ci/100).toFixed(2),'| extra200 months',b.rows.length,'int',(b.ci/100).toFixed(2),'saved',((a.ci-b.ci)/100).toFixed(2));
// 15y/20y totals
for(const y of[15,20,30]){const x=sched(40000000,65000,y*12);console.log(y,'pi',x.pi/100,'int',(x.ci/100).toFixed(2))}
// refinance example: 300k balance, 25y remaining, from 7.5% to 6.5% , costs 6000
const old=pmt(30000000,75000,300),nw=pmt(30000000,65000,300);console.log('old',old/100,'new',nw/100,'save/mo',(old-nw)/100,'breakeven months',Math.ceil(600000/(old-nw)));
